<title>USA: Urban Shopping to buy Chicago-area center.</title>
<headline>Urban Shopping to buy Chicago-area center.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Shopping Centers Inc said on Thursday that it has an agreement in principle to purchase a Chicago-area shopping center for $106 million in cash and securities.</p>
<p>It is buying the center from an affiliate of Zell Merrill Lynch Real Estate Opportunity Partners Ltd Partnership II and an affiliate of JMB Realty Corp.</p>
<p>The deal is subject to $160 million in existing liabilities, it said.</p>
<p>The 1.8 million square foot outdoor shopping area, called Old Orchard Center, is in the northern suburbs of Chicago.</p>
